---
import Stop from "../Stop.astro";
import { SITE } from "../../config";

// Commands verified against the root Makefile (dev, build, run-spa targets)
// and packages/server/internal/config (AIR_HTTP_ADDR default 127.0.0.1:8080).
const clone = [
  `git clone ${SITE.github}.git`,
  "cd 4r-ai-mr-reviewer",
  "(cd packages/spa-b && bun install)",
];
---

<Stop id="self-host" title="Run it yourself" log="your server">
  <div class="prose lead">
    <p>
      You need <strong>Go 1.26+</strong>, <strong>Node 22+</strong> with <strong>bun</strong>,
      and <strong>git</strong>. The server is one Go binary with a SQLite file next to it.
    </p>
  </div>

  <ol class="steps">
    <li class="step">
      <div class="step-text">
        <h3>Get the code</h3>
        <p>Clone the repository and install the web UI's packages once.</p>
      </div>
      <pre><code>{clone.join("\n")}</code></pre>
    </li>

    <li class="step">
      <div class="step-text">
        <h3>Try it locally</h3>
        <p>
          Starts the API server and the web UI together. Open
          <code>http://localhost:5173</code>; the UI proxies <code>/api</code> to the server.
        </p>
      </div>
      <pre><code>make dev</code></pre>
    </li>

    <li class="step">
      <div class="step-text">
        <h3>Run the server binary</h3>
        <p>
          Listens on <code>127.0.0.1:8080</code> by default. Set <code>AIR_HTTP_ADDR</code> to
          change it, for example <code>AIR_HTTP_ADDR=:8080</code> in a container. The binary
          serves the HTTP API; run the web UI against it with <code>make run-spa</code>.
        </p>
      </div>
      <pre><code>{"make build\n./bin/air-server"}</code></pre>
    </li>
  </ol>

  <p class="aside">
    Deep reviews clone over HTTPS, so the GitLab token needs the <code>read_repository</code>
    scope as well as <code>api</code>. Every setting is in the <a href={SITE.docs}>docs</a>.
  </p>
</Stop>

<style>
  .lead {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .steps {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line-subtle);
  }
  .step {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1.5rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-subtle);
    min-width: 0;
  }
  @media (min-width: 60rem) {
    .step {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.15fr);
      gap: 3rem;
      align-items: start;
    }
  }
  .step-text {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .step p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
  }
  pre {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0.875rem 1rem;
    overflow-x: auto;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: var(--bg-panel);
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: var(--fs-small);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .aside {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    max-width: 64ch;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
  }
</style>
